{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act50side_level_act50side_03_end","storyGroup":"act50side","storySort":7,"storyDependence":"act50side_level_act50side_03_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TD-3","storyName":"不能掉以轻心","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"梓兰和空爆换好装备后，和宝巫迦一同出发，前往狩猎“异兽”。出发前，一行人开开心心地吃了一顿炎火村特产——兔团子。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act50side/level_act50side_03_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act50side_03","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":5,"next":7,"characters":["空爆","梓兰","月见夜","宝巫迦","政宗","义经","斑弥罗"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":4},{"type":"sticker","id":5,"multi":"true","text":"紧急任务","x":"250","y":"200","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"750","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":6,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n委托人     「泡影国国主——宝巫迦」","block":"true"},{"type":"dialog","id":7},{"type":"sticker","id":8,"duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":9,"multi":"true","text":"任务描述","x":"250","y":"200","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"750","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":10,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n据月见夜将军的手下回报，雪山出现了异变，推断是由“异兽”造成的影响。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":11,"multi":"true","text":"\\n“异兽”乃是泡影国的宿命之敌，若不尽早狩猎，一旦“诅咒”蔓延，后果不堪设想……","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":12,"multi":"true","text":"\\n请“异兽猎人”即刻随吾出征，完成对本轮“异兽”的狩猎！","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":13,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n任务报酬    归乡之途","block":"true"},{"type":"dialog","id":14},{"type":"sticker","id":15,"duration":"1"},{"type":"dialog","id":16},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_bg_71_g4_bambooforest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":17},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":18},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":19},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":20},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":21,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"“异兽猎人”空爆，准备出发！","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"该带的东西都带好了吧？","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"让我看看，帐篷、携带食料、钓竿、望远镜、十字镐、捕虫网、烤肉组合——","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"报告，都带好了！","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":30},{"type":"charslot","id":31},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_knockhead_cartoon","volume":"1","id":32},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.4","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"m","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我们不是去玩探险游戏的！","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"还有，你是从哪里搞来这些东西的？","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"都是这两天城里的好心人们给我的，我们毕竟也算英雄嘛，大家对我可好了。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"而且这些都是很有用的狩猎道具！","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"m","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我是搞不懂这些东西对狩猎“异兽”有什么帮助。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"先熟悉周围的环境和地形再进行狩猎也不失为一种选择。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"异变怎么样了？","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"根据斥候的情报，走在雪山中，时不时会感受到热浪的存在……","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"这毫无疑问是“异兽”的杰作。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"但两位也不必急于一时，就目前而言，异变看起来还没有从雪山蔓延开。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"还是趁早解决吧。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"而且我看宝巫迦已经忍不住啦！","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"……吾没有忍不住。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"你手里的斧子还有你的眼神不是这么说的哦，宝巫迦。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"不过，有一件事我很好奇，狩猎真的需要来这么多人吗？","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"我还以为只是我、梓兰姐和宝巫迦的事呢。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":65},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice3","volume":"1","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"当然喵，这不是简单的狩猎，当然是人越多越好喵！","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$7","focus":"m","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"有我给你们当向导，事半功倍喵！","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"还有这家伙喵！","id":71},{"type":"charslot","id":72},{"type":"dialog","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":74},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":75},{"type":"charslot","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"好威风的牙兽！","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$5","focus":"m","id":79},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice1","volume":"0.8","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"义经","text":"（威胁的低吼）","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"哈哈，别这么凶嘛！","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#3","focus":"m","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"他是——","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_char_278_orchid_3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":86},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice1","volume":"1","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"他不太放心你们喵！","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"我们会跟着你们行动喵。","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"将军呢，将军不会打算跟吾等一起行动吧？","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"陛下放心，我当然相信陛下。","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"这段时间，斥候们在竹林中发现了许多受“诅咒”侵染的野兽们互相残杀的痕迹。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"这不太寻常，我打算带队亲自收集一些情报。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"只是顺路来为陛下送行而已。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"放心吧，只要陛下狩猎的目标不改变，我不会对您的狩猎进行任何干涉。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾现在就想把狩猎的目标换成你……","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"那也未尝不可。","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"……哼。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"那么，陛下，祝您狩猎顺利。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":109},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":110},{"type":"charslot","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"斑弥罗呢，你要跟我们一起去吗？","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"我才懒得去。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"要不是要给你们送装备，我连门都懒得出。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"快点换上试试吧，为了加紧给你们打造这两套装备，我可是一晚上没睡，累死我了。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"我要回去补觉了。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":121},{"type":"charslot","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"嘻嘻，新装备，新装备！","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"唉……","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":127},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":128},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":129},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":130},{"type":"dialog","id":131},{"type":"charslot","id":132},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.6","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":134},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":136},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"1","id":137,"musicid":1},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_71_i02.png","fadetime":"1","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","id":138},{"type":"imagetween","image":"24_i05","fadetime":"1","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","id":139},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":140},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"哇哦，梓兰姐，这套衣服穿上真的好合身啊。","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"废话，设计图是我亲手改过的，要是不合身，就一定是斑弥罗的手艺有问题。","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"那斑弥罗的手艺还不错嘛。","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"算是吧。","id":145},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice1","volume":"1","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"穿上新装备的感觉如何喵？","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"嗯……好像感觉身体轻盈了一些，而且，力量似乎也有所提高。","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"确实……虽然这种感觉很微妙，不过，的确能感觉到力量……这到底是什么原理？","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"是特殊的锻造技艺喵！","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"总之对狩猎有好处喵！","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"也就是说你其实也不懂吧。","id":152},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice1","volume":"0.8","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"义经","text":"（赞同的低吼）","id":154},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice3","volume":"1","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"才不是喵！我是隐秘队的成员，又不是加工商的学徒喵！不知道很正常喵！","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"唔哦，这就是我的新武器吗！","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"没错，这和你之前顺手拿的那把可不一样喵！是真正为了狩猎而存在的武器喵！","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"嘿嘿……我现在好想砍点什么东西啊。","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"义经，就决定是你了！","id":160},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice2","volume":"0.8","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"义经","text":"（不屑的低吼）","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"梓兰，来试着射中我头上的苹果喵！","id":163},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_creek","volume":"1","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"……","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"哈哈，梓兰姐嘴上说着对狩猎不感兴趣，结果还是兴致勃勃的嘛。","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"既然我要用这把弓，我当然要好好用它。","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"反倒是你，别又和平时一样三分钟热度，过一会儿又喊着要换武器。","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"不会的啦！","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"我有预感，盾斧就是我命中注定的武器！","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"它最好是。","id":171},{"type":"text","text":"在简单的适应过后，两人没有过多停留，就和宝巫迦踏上了出发的道路。","id":172},{"type":"text","text":"空爆的心中，满是对前程的期待，她对新的武器十分感兴趣，发自内心地希望能够挑战更强大的对手。","id":173},{"type":"text","text":"而梓兰则一如往常地满怀忧愁，她知道，前方等待着她们的，绝不是轻松的战斗。","id":174},{"type":"text","text":"不过，至少经过自己调整的这套新的装备在外观上十分符合她的审美，这稍稍让她高兴了一点。","id":175},{"type":"dialog","id":176},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":177},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":178},{"type":"dialog","id":179},{"type":"image","id":180},{"type":"charslot","id":181},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_bg_71_g4_bambooforest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":182},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":183},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":184},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":186},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice1","volume":"1","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"对了，还有一件事要做喵！","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"什么事？","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"接下来可能随时要面临战斗了喵。","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"既然要战斗，不吃一顿属于猎人的大餐可不行喵！","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"什么，有大餐吃？！","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$7","focus":"m","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"没错喵！","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"我来请你们吃炎火村的名产——","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"什么，会有很好吃的肉吗！","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$7","focus":"m","id":203},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice2","volume":"1","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"“兔团子”喵！","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"欸——说到猎人的大餐，难道不应该大口吃肉、大口喝酒吗？","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"甜点……我就免了。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"这是偏见喵！","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":212},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice1","volume":"1","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"吃了团子你们就知错了喵！","id":214},{"type":"dialog","id":215},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":216},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":217},{"type":"bgeffect","id":218},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":219},{"type":"image","id":220},{"type":"charslot","id":221}],"characters":["空爆","梓兰","月见夜","宝巫迦","政宗","义经","斑弥罗"]}